>   - hisilicon,hip07-sec device nodes and their supporting mbigen_alg /
>     smmu_alg infrastructure from arch/arm64/boot/dts/hisilicon/hip07.dtsi
> 
> Signed-off-by: Chenghai Huang <huangchenghai2@huawei.com>
