v3->v4:
- Shortened the comment describing the calculation of RTC_PCLK.
- Updated usleep_range() value to use 2 * rtc->sync_time.

v2->v3:
- No changes.

v1->v2:
- Initialized rate variable to 32768 to avoid timeout_us of 0.
